     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>I&#39;d like to generate overlapping histograms based on user-selected variables in the UI.  Below is a toy MRE with three variables in the df and in the checkboxGroupInput.<div>Ideally, the resulting plot would have 3,2,1, or zero overlapping histogram bars, depending on the user selection.  I&#39;ve also attached a sample image of what the overlapping histogram might look like.</div><div><br></div><div>the code:</div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># some play data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>my_df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rock </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paper </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scissors </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  checkboxGroupInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;attr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Attribute&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;rock&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;paper&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;scissors&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;rock&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;paper&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ggvisOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plot1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vis </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># following the form of the move explorer example in the shiny gallery</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    xvar </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;x&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">symbol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$attr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    my_df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xvar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span 